WEBVTT

01:01.070 --> 01:03.790
Ride the horsey.

01:05.200 --> 01:07.150
Father, faster!

01:09.840 --> 01:10.840
Are you having fun?

01:10.950 --> 01:11.590
Yes.

01:16.150 --> 01:17.040
Crown Prince.

01:17.430 --> 01:17.950
Here.

01:23.760 --> 01:24.790
Is it good?

01:32.840 --> 01:33.480
What's wrong?

01:33.680 --> 01:34.480
What's wrong?

01:34.608 --> 01:35.696
Call the Imperial Physician!

01:35.710 --> 01:36.760
Call the Imperial Physician!

01:36.760 --> 01:38.112
Hurry! Call the Imperial Physician!

01:38.120 --> 01:38.710
Someone, hurry!

01:38.710 --> 01:40.150
- Your Highness!
- Huayong!

01:40.150 --> 01:40.920
Huayong!

01:40.920 --> 01:41.480
Your Highness!

01:41.480 --> 01:41.950
Huayong!

01:41.950 --> 01:42.760
Your Highness!

03:30.580 --> 03:31.610
=Blossoms of Power=

03:31.620 --> 03:34.420
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:34.432 --> 03:37.220
=Episode 2=

03:46.540 --> 03:48.850
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
arrives in the Imperial Capital.

03:48.864 --> 03:51.136
Will she bring the northwest
style of makeup with her?

03:51.560 --> 03:52.896
I wonder which prince His Majesty

03:52.912 --> 03:55.230
will betroth the commandery princess
from the northwest to.

03:55.400 --> 03:57.400
Anyone but
that short-lived Crown Prince.

03:57.472 --> 03:59.280
Any of the other princes
could be a match.

04:02.860 --> 04:04.700
(Tingyun Villa)

04:04.710 --> 04:06.560
Move a little faster, all of you.

04:07.520 --> 04:09.000
(Wedding Scrolls)
On the wedding day,

04:09.010 --> 04:11.450
the whole city will be filled
with lanterns and red decorations.

04:11.460 --> 04:13.020
There won't be enough
red silk or lanterns to sell.

04:13.030 --> 04:13.870
Young Master,

04:13.960 --> 04:15.310
what can I get for you?

04:15.840 --> 04:16.480
Well,

04:16.688 --> 04:18.288
(Wedding Scrolls)
I see you've stocked up

04:18.288 --> 04:19.700
on red silk for all the princes.

04:19.720 --> 04:21.360
Why is there none for the Crown Prince?

04:22.680 --> 04:23.830
Keep your voice down.

04:27.390 --> 04:29.310
That's a taboo.

04:29.408 --> 04:30.720
The Crown Prince was poisoned.

04:30.720 --> 04:31.480
Everyone knows that.

04:31.480 --> 04:33.750
How could the commandery princess
possibly marry him?

04:37.000 --> 04:38.040
You truly

04:38.480 --> 04:40.000
have remarkable insight.

04:40.240 --> 04:41.040
Of course.

04:41.190 --> 04:42.160
On this whole street,

04:42.160 --> 04:43.920
no one has a sharper eye than I do,

04:44.832 --> 04:46.480
and see if there's anything you need.

04:48.220 --> 04:51.620
(Suzhou Post Station)

05:39.440 --> 05:41.240
It seems Your Highness
has recovered well.

05:41.630 --> 05:43.070
Now I can rest easy

05:43.070 --> 05:45.136
leaving Your Highness
in the local governor's care.

05:45.160 --> 05:46.040
What do you mean?

05:46.160 --> 05:47.696
Your Highness is a man unrelated to me.

05:47.700 --> 05:48.950
I only came to your aid yesterday

05:48.950 --> 05:50.240
because the situation was urgent.

05:51.040 --> 05:53.190
Now that Your Highness is out of danger,

05:53.232 --> 05:55.152
I should avoid
any appearance of impropriety.

05:59.800 --> 06:00.750
Shen Xihe.

06:01.430 --> 06:03.360
I've been hunted
ever since leaving Guangling.

06:03.370 --> 06:05.264
Then I happened to run
into you at death's door.

06:05.300 --> 06:07.040
Don't tell me
it was all just a coincidence.

06:07.050 --> 06:08.310
You've been back to the imperial capital

06:08.310 --> 06:09.584
to receive an imperial marriage.

06:11.430 --> 06:13.070
You made me owe you my life,

06:13.424 --> 06:15.000
and stayed by my side day and night.

06:15.870 --> 06:16.510
What's this?

06:17.310 --> 06:19.720
Now you're putting on
an act of playing hard to get?

06:20.600 --> 06:21.720
Hard to get?

06:23.728 --> 06:25.328
Have you forgotten, Your Highness,

06:25.830 --> 06:27.270
that yesterday you were the one

06:27.270 --> 06:28.480
who threw in the jade pendant?

06:36.160 --> 06:37.190
As for status,

06:37.430 --> 06:38.950
you are no match for the Crown Prince.

06:39.360 --> 06:40.310
As for reputation,

06:40.400 --> 06:42.070
you cannot compare to the Second Prince.

06:42.630 --> 06:43.600
As for looks,

06:43.750 --> 06:45.270
you are far behind the Sixth Prince.

06:45.800 --> 06:46.800
As for talent,

06:46.944 --> 06:49.616
you cannot compare to your
own elder brother, the Fifth Prince.

06:50.120 --> 06:51.370
Why would I ever fall for you?

06:59.600 --> 07:00.830
How dare you!

07:34.680 --> 07:35.480
You saved my life.

07:36.750 --> 07:38.310
I'll let it slide this time.

07:38.320 --> 07:40.530
There's no need to feel indebted
to me, Your Highness.

07:41.160 --> 07:42.600
Let's just pretend we never met.

07:43.120 --> 07:44.040
Let's part ways here.

08:05.070 --> 08:05.630
Your Highness.

08:08.510 --> 08:09.830
I've followed the trail

08:09.904 --> 08:11.240
and found the Jade Frost Flower.

08:11.510 --> 08:12.600
But the hiding place

08:12.600 --> 08:13.560
had already been dug up.

08:13.600 --> 08:15.296
The Rouge Ledger is nowhere to be found.

08:19.190 --> 08:20.310
As for who took it,

08:20.390 --> 08:21.390
I have failed in my duty.

08:21.660 --> 08:22.750
I still haven't found out.

08:22.760 --> 08:23.510
Prepare the horses.

08:23.510 --> 08:24.240
Your Highness.

08:24.720 --> 08:26.160
They took our horses.

08:26.688 --> 08:27.830
There's only this one left

08:28.480 --> 08:29.430
in the stable.

08:33.080 --> 08:35.080
(Seriously injured. Not fit for riding.)

08:37.270 --> 08:38.790
She must have it.

08:40.030 --> 08:41.550
I really underestimated her.

08:43.320 --> 08:44.750
Shen Xihe.

08:46.270 --> 08:47.440
Just you wait.

08:52.784 --> 08:55.260
(Crown Prince, Prince Ning, Prince Ding,
Prince Yu, Prince Lie, Prince Xin)

08:55.270 --> 08:56.000
Your Highness,

08:56.270 --> 08:57.480
why does it seem

08:57.480 --> 08:59.030
like you know these princes?

09:00.000 --> 09:02.240
Your Highness is even
better informed than me.

09:02.656 --> 09:03.792
Know your enemy and yourself,

09:03.792 --> 09:05.890
and you stand an equal chance
of victory or defeat.

09:06.128 --> 09:07.728
Know neither your enemy nor yourself,

09:07.904 --> 09:09.080
and you'll lose every battle.

09:10.240 --> 09:11.600
Marrying the wrong man

09:11.632 --> 09:13.030
is like entering the wrong forest.

09:13.630 --> 09:14.840
The path is full of thorns.

09:14.870 --> 09:16.630
One should make plans
as early as possible.

09:17.360 --> 09:18.720
The Second Prince, Prince Ning.

09:19.120 --> 09:20.390
The Fourth Prince, Prince Ding.

09:20.750 --> 09:22.000
The Sixth Prince, Prince Yu.

09:22.550 --> 09:24.080
Among these three princes,

09:24.270 --> 09:25.720
Prince Ning is the foremost.

09:25.750 --> 09:27.920
He is backed by a veteran
who has served three reigns,

09:27.936 --> 09:28.896
the Ministry of Justice,

09:28.896 --> 09:29.904
and the Ministry of Rites.

09:30.030 --> 09:31.790
The Ninth Prince, Prince Lie,

09:32.000 --> 09:33.480
is Noble Consort Rong's second son.

09:34.200 --> 09:36.390
Though still young,
he holds an exalted status.

09:36.720 --> 09:38.270
Prince Lie is bold and high-spirited.

09:38.400 --> 09:40.512
He will make
a formidable battlefield general.

09:42.120 --> 09:43.270
Most importantly,

09:44.480 --> 09:46.870
Changqing is there
to strategize for him.

09:47.030 --> 09:49.360
The Fifth Prince, Prince Xin,
is exceptionally gifted.

09:49.600 --> 09:51.360
But after Prince Xin's Consort
passed away,

09:51.360 --> 09:53.600
he lost heart and turned to prayer.

09:53.600 --> 09:54.944
He withdrew from worldly affairs.

09:55.120 --> 09:56.910
Changqing has always been ambitious.

09:57.050 --> 09:59.720
Everyone thinks he's stayed out
of worldly affairs all these years.

10:00.016 --> 10:02.700
But they've forgotten what he was
like before Gu Qingzhi's downfall.

10:03.790 --> 10:06.030
How decisive
and meticulous Changqing was.

10:11.270 --> 10:12.870
- He will return.
- He will return.

10:23.080 --> 10:23.840
Qingqing.

10:24.960 --> 10:27.264
(The Late Lady Gu)
I failed to protect you back then.

10:27.840 --> 10:28.790
It was my fault.

10:29.870 --> 10:32.512
Today, I oversaw the execution
of all 69 members of the Gu family.

10:32.600 --> 10:33.270
Do you hate me?

10:33.600 --> 10:34.510
Why should I?

10:34.750 --> 10:36.240
The Gu family held too much power.

10:36.910 --> 10:39.000
The Fan family had long wanted us gone.

10:39.320 --> 10:40.600
My father was outmatched.

10:40.960 --> 10:42.080
He accepted defeat.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.270
Gu Qingzhi.

10:45.390 --> 10:46.390
You have no heart.

10:48.750 --> 10:49.960
Your blood runs cold.

10:50.790 --> 10:52.270
Only by being heartless

10:52.750 --> 10:54.030
can a lady

10:54.550 --> 10:56.480
truly live free and happy.

10:57.870 --> 10:59.030
I wonder, Your Highness,

10:59.910 --> 11:01.480
what you plan to do

11:01.870 --> 11:03.550
with me, the last survivor.

11:04.000 --> 11:05.200
I pleaded with Father.

11:06.510 --> 11:08.320
You are still my Princess Consort.

11:09.150 --> 11:11.000
What an unwise decision.

11:11.632 --> 11:13.950
Protecting the powerless daughter
of a condemned official

11:13.960 --> 11:15.232
who has nothing but a pretty face

11:15.312 --> 11:17.030
will only make more enemies for yourself

11:17.056 --> 11:19.360
and drive a wedge between you
and your trusted followers.

11:20.200 --> 11:22.150
Your Highness should personally
see me on my way.

11:25.390 --> 11:26.200
Qingqing.

11:27.600 --> 11:29.670
I, Xiao Changqing, swear on my life

11:32.790 --> 11:34.440
to protect you
for the rest of your life.

11:37.550 --> 11:38.790
Your Highness, your love

11:39.910 --> 11:41.510
is destined to be wasted on me.

11:45.030 --> 11:46.150
This is Sangluo liquor,

11:46.910 --> 11:48.790
specially sent by the Fan family.

11:49.790 --> 11:51.080
A rare vintage.

11:56.910 --> 11:57.480
Qingqing.

11:58.240 --> 11:58.910
Qingqing!

11:59.670 --> 12:00.840
Qingqing!

12:03.168 --> 12:04.870
(Qing)
The trap you risked your life to set

12:06.120 --> 12:08.200
to bury the Fan family
with the Gu family,

12:09.270 --> 12:10.630
I've carried through for you.

12:12.840 --> 12:14.200
I'll stay by your side

12:17.270 --> 12:18.510
until the day I die.

12:27.150 --> 12:27.840
Your Highness.

12:28.870 --> 12:30.000
Prince Lie was ambushed.

12:30.080 --> 12:31.680
Commandery Princess Zhaoning saved him,

12:31.728 --> 12:32.960
but stole the Rouge Ledger.

12:35.920 --> 12:37.960
Escort Prince Lie
back to the capital at once.

12:40.440 --> 12:41.670
Recover the Rouge Ledger

12:43.390 --> 12:44.390
at any cost.

12:44.630 --> 12:45.080
Yes.

13:09.960 --> 13:10.480
Move it!

13:11.670 --> 13:12.080
Hurry!

13:28.870 --> 13:30.240
They look like a band of bandits.

13:30.630 --> 13:32.440
These men live by the blade.

13:32.440 --> 13:33.200
They're ruthless.

13:33.600 --> 13:35.000
Your Highness, should we save them?

13:35.080 --> 13:36.200
Of course.

13:37.120 --> 13:39.080
Though Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is clever,

13:39.080 --> 13:39.980
at the end of the day,

13:40.240 --> 13:41.790
she's still a young lady.

13:41.790 --> 13:42.928
Faced with a force like this,

13:42.960 --> 13:44.512
how could she not lose her composure?

13:47.480 --> 13:47.960
Wait.

13:50.944 --> 13:52.368
The commandery princess

13:52.400 --> 13:54.000
doesn't seem to be in the carriage.

14:12.630 --> 14:13.150
Fall back.

14:19.216 --> 14:20.000
Your Highness,

14:20.600 --> 14:21.480
it seems

14:21.480 --> 14:23.200
commandery princess
doesn't need our help.

14:25.080 --> 14:26.390
She foresaw

14:27.550 --> 14:29.030
today's ambush.

14:29.568 --> 14:32.000
I'd heard Commandery Princess Zhaoning
was raised in luxury.

14:32.320 --> 14:34.630
How did she develop
such remarkable composure?

14:35.120 --> 14:36.510
That's foresight.

14:37.440 --> 14:38.630
It's a step above

14:38.992 --> 14:40.400
keeping calm under pressure.

14:41.320 --> 14:42.910
Now that the bandits are dealt with,

14:43.520 --> 14:44.304
Your Highness,

14:44.688 --> 14:47.216
the commandery princess
should be able to continue her journey.

14:47.750 --> 14:49.200
Such a direct attack

14:49.380 --> 14:51.000
doesn't seem like
Xiao Changqing's style.

14:51.710 --> 14:53.480
Your Highness truly
sees through everything.

14:53.480 --> 14:55.104
The bandits have all been driven off.

14:55.720 --> 14:56.670
It's not that simple.

14:56.960 --> 14:57.960
Xiao Changqing

14:58.240 --> 14:59.910
always plans before he acts.

15:00.360 --> 15:01.840
If the bandits couldn't deal with us,

15:02.100 --> 15:04.290
he could call in
the local authorities to wipe us out.

15:04.380 --> 15:05.630
According to Changqing's style,

15:05.632 --> 15:07.630
he'd send government troops
to eliminate the bandits

15:07.648 --> 15:08.670
under a legitimate pretext,

15:08.688 --> 15:10.870
and the commandery princess
was accidentally killed.

15:27.610 --> 15:29.808
The authorities,
under orders to suppress the bandits,

15:29.856 --> 15:31.150
would execute anyone

15:31.216 --> 15:33.296
who refused to lay down
their arms and surrender.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.480
You were right!

15:34.480 --> 15:36.224
You got it exactly right, Your Highness.

15:42.550 --> 15:43.120
Your Highness,

15:43.600 --> 15:44.600
should we step in?

17:01.120 --> 17:01.960
Who are you?

17:02.368 --> 17:04.000
How dare you kill government troops?

17:04.270 --> 17:05.350
That's a capital offense!

17:08.448 --> 17:10.736
The Embroidered Envoys
are conducting official business.

17:11.070 --> 17:12.350
Anyone who interferes

17:12.528 --> 17:14.640
(Embroidered Envoy)
will be executed without mercy.

17:15.744 --> 17:17.870
I was ordered to come here
and suppress the bandits.

17:17.880 --> 17:19.870
I had no idea
I'd disturbed the Embroidered Envoy.

17:19.920 --> 17:20.944
Please forgive my offense.

17:21.030 --> 17:22.590
The Embroidered Envoy?

17:23.000 --> 17:24.480
They are the Emperor's most secret

17:24.480 --> 17:25.830
covert organization.

17:25.880 --> 17:27.232
There are only thirteen of them.

17:27.250 --> 17:29.890
They hold the tiger tally and
have the authority to command troops.

17:29.900 --> 17:32.590
They can throw any official below
the third rank directly into prison.

17:32.608 --> 17:34.720
All civil and military officials
fear them deeply.

17:35.350 --> 17:37.680
Only the Emperor
knows their true identities.

17:38.160 --> 17:39.680
The bandits have all been captured.

17:40.310 --> 17:41.680
You should return and report back.

17:42.240 --> 17:42.720
Yes.

17:50.270 --> 17:51.110
(This scent...)

17:51.480 --> 17:52.720
(Tagara Incense again.)

17:55.590 --> 17:56.640
Where are you headed?

17:57.270 --> 17:58.200
Reporting to you, sir,

17:58.830 --> 18:01.000
we're on our way to Guangwu City.

18:01.310 --> 18:03.480
Who would've thought
we'd run into bandits?

18:03.880 --> 18:04.920
Then be on your way.

18:05.350 --> 18:06.720
The city gates will soon close.

18:12.160 --> 18:12.830
You may leave!

18:24.030 --> 18:25.240
Thank you for your help, sir.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.590
We'll take our leave.

18:39.590 --> 18:41.680
The Embroidered Envoy suddenly appeared

18:41.880 --> 18:43.200
and even helped us.

18:43.968 --> 18:46.000
The Embroidered Envoys
never linger for anyone.

18:46.480 --> 18:48.640
What happened today is truly unusual.

18:52.400 --> 18:54.000
The Tagara Incense he's wearing

18:54.000 --> 18:55.000
is of the finest quality.

18:55.880 --> 18:56.510
Just one tael

18:56.790 --> 18:58.160
is worth a hundred taels of gold.

18:59.550 --> 19:00.480
Why would

19:00.736 --> 19:02.720
an Embroidered Envoy
use something so precious?

19:03.720 --> 19:04.510
Besides,

19:05.310 --> 19:06.350
this Embroidered Envoy

19:06.350 --> 19:07.880
has the exact same scent

19:08.030 --> 19:09.000
as Hua Fuhai.

19:11.744 --> 19:13.040
It's too much of a coincidence.

19:19.312 --> 19:20.096
Your Highness.

19:26.110 --> 19:26.680
Your Highness.

19:26.768 --> 19:28.200
Why didn't you take this opportunity

19:28.224 --> 19:30.512
to take the Rouge Ledger
from the commandery princess?

19:31.310 --> 19:32.750
Unless she gives it up willingly,

19:33.030 --> 19:34.920
taking the Rouge Ledger from her

19:35.160 --> 19:36.200
will be no easy task.

19:36.352 --> 19:37.728
What about the Immortal Vine?

19:38.070 --> 19:39.310
Even if you don't need it now,

19:39.344 --> 19:41.780
you can present it to Grand
Empress Dowager as a birthday gift.

19:41.790 --> 19:43.712
The Immortal Vine
is shaped like a lover's knot,

19:43.790 --> 19:45.200
symbolizing everlasting unity.

19:45.616 --> 19:47.110
How could I give it to Grandmother?

19:51.880 --> 19:52.720
Oh, no.

19:53.270 --> 19:55.070
My brilliant prince

19:55.830 --> 19:57.030
has really fallen for her.

19:57.960 --> 19:59.030
It's not love.

20:00.920 --> 20:01.960
It's like

20:04.270 --> 20:06.720
seeing a bright moon in the sky.

20:07.480 --> 20:08.680
If I didn't admire it,

20:09.790 --> 20:11.680
I'd be the one who lacked appreciation.

20:21.616 --> 20:22.310
Your Highness,

20:22.400 --> 20:23.808
your poison is acting up again.

20:42.180 --> 20:44.500
(Prince Xin's Manor)

20:56.880 --> 20:59.744
Changqing, how could you send men
to kill Commandery Princess Zhaoning?

20:59.960 --> 21:01.920
She stole the Rouge Ledger from you,

21:02.448 --> 21:03.872
and you're still protecting her?

21:03.920 --> 21:05.480
The Duke of Wei is loyal to the throne.

21:05.480 --> 21:06.510
He's an upright official.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.480
So what if she took it?

21:25.030 --> 21:26.350
You risked your life

21:27.312 --> 21:29.904
and went through countless hardships
to obtain the Rouge Ledger.

21:30.240 --> 21:31.200
What is it for?

21:34.720 --> 21:36.480
No enemy on the battlefield
can defeat you.

21:36.830 --> 21:38.830
But the schemes of powerful ministers

21:39.750 --> 21:41.160
are far harder for you to withstand.

21:43.160 --> 21:44.350
With the Rouge Ledger,

21:45.510 --> 21:47.310
we can root out the corrupt officials

21:47.310 --> 21:48.310
at court.

21:48.640 --> 21:50.350
Then we can build our own influence.

21:50.480 --> 21:52.200
Only then will your position be secure.

21:52.200 --> 21:52.960
Changqing,

21:54.790 --> 21:56.160
I've told you many times already.

21:56.816 --> 21:58.544
I don't want
to get involved in politics.

22:14.480 --> 22:16.830
Right now, you're only
the General of the Imperial Guard.

22:18.790 --> 22:20.790
You have no place at court.

22:26.510 --> 22:27.960
How can you protect

22:29.270 --> 22:30.310
the one you care about?

22:37.440 --> 22:38.030
Your Highness.

22:38.080 --> 22:39.590
Commandery Princess Zhaoning's party

22:39.590 --> 22:41.296
is nearing
the imperial capital by water.

22:42.030 --> 22:42.640
Changqing,

22:43.440 --> 22:44.720
you mustn't harm her again.

22:46.192 --> 22:47.584
You can't bring yourself to do it?

22:50.480 --> 22:51.030
No.

22:52.000 --> 22:53.480
That lady is cold and heartless.

22:54.310 --> 22:55.550
I can't stand her.

22:59.392 --> 23:01.160
They're too close
to the imperial capital.

23:03.030 --> 23:04.720
Whether you like her or not,

23:07.350 --> 23:08.720
you can't touch her for now.

23:28.680 --> 23:29.270
Boatman,

23:30.070 --> 23:31.350
when will the boat depart?

23:32.070 --> 23:32.880
In an hour.

23:33.400 --> 23:34.680
If there are enough passengers,

23:34.680 --> 23:35.310
- Your Highness.
- we can set sail now.

23:35.310 --> 23:36.310
We'll go buy some flowers.

23:36.320 --> 23:37.110
Please wait a moment.

23:37.110 --> 23:38.000
Come take a look.

23:38.400 --> 23:39.070
Just let me know.

23:39.070 --> 23:40.288
These flowers are so beautiful.

23:40.550 --> 23:41.310
They really are.

23:42.070 --> 23:43.550
Look over there. It's so lively.

23:43.550 --> 23:44.070
It is.

23:44.100 --> 23:45.350
Come on, let's go take a look.

23:45.350 --> 23:45.880
Let's go.

24:11.920 --> 24:13.000
You're hurt.

24:38.000 --> 24:39.110
Where's your owner?

24:48.350 --> 24:49.880
So you're all alone, too.

24:51.030 --> 24:52.510
How about I take you home?

24:55.480 --> 24:56.550
You...

24:57.030 --> 24:58.240
shall be called Du Huo.

25:01.880 --> 25:03.590
It seems you really like that name.

25:14.680 --> 25:15.310
Your Highness,

25:15.600 --> 25:17.808
you've protected
the commandery princess all the way.

25:17.810 --> 25:19.680
Even if you're not
expecting anything in return,

25:19.690 --> 25:21.360
you should at least get
a word of thanks.

25:21.510 --> 25:23.350
Instead, you're hiding here

25:23.750 --> 25:24.640
spying on her.

25:25.000 --> 25:26.270
This commandery princess

25:27.830 --> 25:29.160
has more than just two sides.

25:31.000 --> 25:32.750
She has quite a few.

25:34.920 --> 25:35.960
Little fox.

25:36.350 --> 25:37.790
Whether she's a fox or a tiger,

25:37.920 --> 25:39.376
if we've got the Rouge Ledger,

25:39.640 --> 25:40.880
we'd better keep our distance.

25:49.070 --> 25:49.880
Tian Yuan.

25:51.030 --> 25:52.880
Her smile is truly beautiful.

25:55.880 --> 25:56.480
Your Highness,

25:56.750 --> 25:57.720
don't you think

25:57.790 --> 25:59.790
the commandery princess
seems rather calculating,

26:01.440 --> 26:02.960
even a little frightening?

26:03.070 --> 26:04.208
What's frightening about her?

26:05.830 --> 26:06.830
She's clearly

26:09.720 --> 26:10.480
adorable.

26:19.070 --> 26:20.480
- All right.
- Bravo!

26:22.680 --> 26:23.400
Take this one.

26:23.400 --> 26:24.240
This one's pretty.

26:27.510 --> 26:28.310
Over here!

26:28.310 --> 26:29.070
This way!

26:29.350 --> 26:30.310
It's so lively.

26:31.240 --> 26:32.070
Be careful.

26:39.160 --> 26:40.110
Here, take it.

26:40.432 --> 26:41.270
These are yours.

26:45.632 --> 26:47.568
Come on, let's go
set floating lanterns adrift.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.030
Your Highness,

26:51.400 --> 26:52.720
it's the Fishing Lantern Festival.

26:53.070 --> 26:55.200
The people pray
for abundance year after year

26:55.200 --> 26:56.608
and that everything goes smoothly.

26:59.920 --> 27:00.790
Your Highness,

27:00.790 --> 27:01.960
it's so adorable.

27:02.030 --> 27:03.400
Have you given it a name?

27:04.030 --> 27:04.960
It's called Du Huo.

27:05.728 --> 27:07.310
Why would Your Highness give a cat

27:07.310 --> 27:08.830
such a strange name?

27:09.510 --> 27:10.720
When all flowers have withered,

27:11.030 --> 27:12.110
I alone remain.

27:13.088 --> 27:13.880
Isn't that fitting?

27:18.270 --> 27:20.590
Good!

27:25.160 --> 27:26.310
Enjoy the lanterns.

27:26.544 --> 27:27.960
I'll head back and get some rest.

27:30.270 --> 27:31.270
- Good!
- Great!

27:43.790 --> 27:46.310
Excuse me, is this
Commandery Princess Zhaoning's boat?

27:46.550 --> 27:47.550
May I ask who you are?

27:49.296 --> 27:51.792
I am Cui Jinbai, Vice Minister
of the Court of Judicial Review.

27:55.610 --> 27:56.640
Greetings, Your Highness.

27:57.830 --> 27:59.550
May I ask why you wish to see me?

28:01.310 --> 28:03.030
I have been waiting here
for Your Highness

28:03.360 --> 28:05.408
regarding the case
of the escaped maid Ling Long.

28:05.472 --> 28:06.830
I need to ask you a few questions.

28:07.200 --> 28:08.000
Please rest assured.

28:08.590 --> 28:10.440
I won't keep Your Highness for long.

28:10.864 --> 28:11.640
This way, please.

28:32.720 --> 28:33.830
What does Your Highness

28:34.030 --> 28:34.960
usually like to eat?

28:35.750 --> 28:37.590
I prefer light food
and dislike greasy dishes.

28:37.648 --> 28:39.240
I don't have any particular favorite.

28:40.160 --> 28:42.030
What do you usually do
in your spare time?

28:43.070 --> 28:44.830
Nothing out of the ordinary.

28:45.392 --> 28:46.720
I blend incense and do needlework,

28:47.136 --> 28:48.350
read and practice calligraphy.

28:50.110 --> 28:51.400
In your daily life,

28:51.400 --> 28:52.800
do you have any special preferences?

28:52.920 --> 28:54.070
If I had to name one,

28:55.110 --> 28:57.160
I'd enjoy collecting
rare flowers and herbs.

28:57.520 --> 28:59.184
I savor their fragrance and admire them.

29:02.960 --> 29:05.480
"Clad in orchids and duheng,

29:06.590 --> 29:09.680
I pluck fragrant blooms
for the one I long for."

29:10.656 --> 29:12.304
What refined taste, Your Highness.

29:13.270 --> 29:15.640
But what does any of this
have to do with the case?

29:19.480 --> 29:21.270
Ling Long was your personal maid.

29:21.880 --> 29:24.070
She knew your habits
and preferences inside out.

29:24.590 --> 29:26.000
I'm concerned someone

29:26.000 --> 29:28.030
might exploit those small details.

29:28.160 --> 29:29.744
That's why I took the liberty of asking.

29:38.240 --> 29:40.110
Do you enjoy going on spring outings?

29:40.110 --> 29:41.550
Do you prefer mountain scenery

29:41.550 --> 29:42.720
or waterscapes?

29:47.440 --> 29:48.640
(Tagara Incense again.)

29:57.240 --> 29:58.070
Vice Minister Cui,

29:59.760 --> 30:01.000
there's no need to avoid me.

30:01.790 --> 30:03.200
Why not come aboard my boat

30:03.264 --> 30:04.800
so we can continue our conversation?

30:20.240 --> 30:21.750
- Very well!
- Very well!

30:36.030 --> 30:38.160
Why are you wearing
a veiled hat, Vice Minister Cui?

30:41.270 --> 30:42.310
The journey here

30:43.160 --> 30:44.070
left my face sunburned.

30:44.176 --> 30:45.584
My appearance is rather untidy.

30:45.632 --> 30:47.248
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

30:48.288 --> 30:51.232
Vice Minister Cui is in charge of
criminal investigations and sentencing.

30:51.880 --> 30:52.790
I'd like to know,

30:53.350 --> 30:55.440
if someone impersonates
a court official,

30:55.750 --> 30:56.880
what crime should that be?

31:04.240 --> 31:05.400
This incense is poisonous.

31:07.030 --> 31:07.960
Caning.

31:08.110 --> 31:08.960
Imprisonment.

31:09.400 --> 31:10.160
Execution.

31:10.790 --> 31:11.640
Choose one.

31:25.510 --> 31:26.310
You're faking it.

31:27.310 --> 31:29.110
I'm only honest with the lady I love.

31:29.728 --> 31:31.000
If Your Highness is willing...

31:33.510 --> 31:34.160
Your Highness!

31:34.160 --> 31:35.184
Let go of Her Highness!

31:45.110 --> 31:45.720
Your Highness!

31:51.070 --> 31:52.030
What's wrong?

31:54.830 --> 31:56.110
The commandery princess threw

31:57.270 --> 31:59.000
a numbing powder at me.

31:59.070 --> 32:00.640
What if the anesthetic harms you?

32:03.000 --> 32:04.440
She's still

32:05.640 --> 32:07.030
a kindhearted young lady.

32:08.510 --> 32:09.790
If it's meant for self-defense,

32:11.000 --> 32:12.750
it should be laced with poison.

32:13.480 --> 32:14.590
Just like Hua Fuhai,

32:14.960 --> 32:16.200
it's that Tagara Incense again.

32:19.790 --> 32:20.720
What a pity.

32:21.110 --> 32:23.160
I only mixed
a numbing agent into the powder.

32:24.620 --> 32:25.920
Poison would've been even better.

32:26.736 --> 32:28.928
You're still upset
she didn't poison you to death?

32:30.510 --> 32:32.160
She knew I was in disguise.

32:33.750 --> 32:35.590
Yet she exposed me right to my face.

32:36.750 --> 32:37.790
She's more like

32:40.310 --> 32:41.350
my confidante.

32:41.590 --> 32:42.480
My confidante?

32:42.830 --> 32:43.400
Wait.

32:45.960 --> 32:47.510
Don't tell me you've fallen for her.

32:54.240 --> 32:56.480
A Crown Prince as frail as a willow,

32:59.400 --> 33:01.070
yet infatuated with love.

33:02.400 --> 33:04.510
There couldn't be a better disguise.

33:07.260 --> 33:13.380
(Shangjing, Imperial Capital
of the Daxing Dynasty)

33:22.000 --> 33:22.920
Come take a look!

33:28.256 --> 33:30.160
(Ningxiang Tea House)
Misters. Please come in.

33:30.368 --> 33:31.240
Have a seat inside.

33:32.750 --> 33:34.000
Your tea is ready, Mister.

33:34.270 --> 33:35.240
This way.

33:36.110 --> 33:36.880
Watch your step.

33:37.680 --> 33:38.480
Right there.

33:40.000 --> 33:42.000
Your Highness, it's so lively.

33:57.264 --> 33:59.830
The commandery princess's party
has entered the imperial capital.

34:05.480 --> 34:06.270
Your Highness,

34:06.790 --> 34:07.550
it's time to leave.

34:19.400 --> 34:20.070
Make way!

34:20.440 --> 34:21.110
Make way!

34:21.472 --> 34:22.800
Do you all have a death wish?

34:22.800 --> 34:23.480
Move!

34:27.670 --> 34:28.480
Move!

34:28.480 --> 34:29.440
Are you deaf?

34:29.880 --> 34:30.840
Move!

34:31.070 --> 34:32.030
Move!

34:34.840 --> 34:35.880
I'm talking to you.

34:36.030 --> 34:36.880
Move!

34:37.030 --> 34:38.230
Are you deaf?

34:38.960 --> 34:40.320
I'm talking to you!

34:49.408 --> 34:50.096
Third Brother.

34:50.100 --> 34:51.250
- Second Brother.
- Third Brother.

34:51.264 --> 34:52.070
- Easy.
- Come.

34:52.070 --> 34:52.480
Slow down.

34:54.360 --> 34:55.030
Blood!

34:59.480 --> 35:00.400
How dare you!

35:00.400 --> 35:02.360
Do you have a death wish?
I think you want to die!

35:02.360 --> 35:03.710
I can be even bolder.

35:05.070 --> 35:06.000
Want to find out?

35:12.670 --> 35:14.320
Do you know who I am?

35:14.320 --> 35:16.848
I'm the Third Young Master
of the Marquis of Jining's Manor!

35:21.440 --> 35:22.150
What a loudmouth.

35:23.440 --> 35:24.360
Third Young Master!

35:26.880 --> 35:28.030
You dare whip me?

35:28.360 --> 35:29.030
Get her!

35:33.280 --> 35:34.230
Someone!

35:34.400 --> 35:36.030
They're fighting at the city gate,

35:36.030 --> 35:38.260
and assaulting the descendants
of meritorious officials!

35:44.280 --> 35:44.920
Surround them!

35:45.480 --> 35:46.110
- Yes!
- Yes!

35:48.670 --> 35:49.760
Why are you surrounding me?

35:49.760 --> 35:50.320
Over there!

35:51.824 --> 35:53.550
(Zhang Pengzhan, Prefect of Shangjing)
Prefect Zhang Pengzhan of Shangjing

35:53.550 --> 35:55.088
pays my respects to Your Highness.

35:55.230 --> 35:56.280
I arrived too late.

35:56.280 --> 35:57.630
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

35:58.670 --> 35:59.480
Prefect Zhang,

36:00.030 --> 36:01.510
someone tried to kill me.

36:02.230 --> 36:04.000
I... I didn't know.
I don't even know her.

36:04.064 --> 36:05.440
How could I have tried to kill her?

36:05.440 --> 36:06.150
I know.

36:06.550 --> 36:07.480
You didn't mean to.

36:08.110 --> 36:08.880
Your horse

36:09.480 --> 36:11.550
was driven mad by the scent of basil.

36:11.960 --> 36:13.000
Someone

36:13.000 --> 36:14.440
tampered with your horse.

36:23.260 --> 36:24.304
Reporting to you, Prefect,

36:24.320 --> 36:25.880
we found traces of incense powder.

36:27.320 --> 36:28.070
Prefect Zhang,

36:28.550 --> 36:29.840
I'd like a basin of clean water.

36:30.360 --> 36:30.800
Yes.

36:31.880 --> 36:33.110
This incense powder

36:33.110 --> 36:35.230
contains an ingredient
that reacts with basil.

36:35.710 --> 36:36.840
When the two are mixed,

36:37.030 --> 36:39.070
the water turns red.

36:39.590 --> 36:41.230
Brilliant, Your Highness.

36:42.070 --> 36:43.800
Then I'll ask everyone

36:43.800 --> 36:46.000
to place their hands
in the water, one by one.

36:52.832 --> 36:53.710
What are you doing?

36:53.710 --> 36:54.280
Let go of me!

36:59.360 --> 36:59.960
No!

37:00.150 --> 37:00.880
It wasn't me!

37:01.710 --> 37:03.190
It wasn't me, Your Highness!

37:03.200 --> 37:05.320
If not, why is there the scent
of basil on your hands?

37:05.320 --> 37:06.470
It was Second Young Master Li.

37:06.480 --> 37:07.920
He personally gave me the powder.

37:08.670 --> 37:09.960
Don't you dare slander me!

37:10.280 --> 37:10.880
Mo Yu!

37:14.360 --> 37:15.230
What are you doing?

37:15.312 --> 37:16.304
What are you doing?

37:19.696 --> 37:20.510
Second Brother,

37:21.920 --> 37:23.360
we're brothers.

37:23.800 --> 37:24.880
Why are you framing me?

37:26.360 --> 37:28.590
I just wanted
to get blood on your hands.

37:28.840 --> 37:30.510
So Father would come to despise you.

37:31.590 --> 37:32.190
But...

37:32.520 --> 37:34.690
I never expected to implicate
the commandery princess.

37:34.700 --> 37:37.490
- Does ignorance make you innocent?
- Does ignorance make you innocent?

37:55.550 --> 37:57.030
Greetings, Your Highness.

37:59.248 --> 38:01.680
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

38:03.320 --> 38:05.550
Greetings, Your Highness.

38:11.960 --> 38:12.960
Please rise, Xihe.

38:13.000 --> 38:14.304
There's no need for formalities.

38:18.710 --> 38:20.480
(Plum blossoms kissed with snow.)

38:21.110 --> 38:22.670
(This fragrance is Spring in Snow.)

38:22.880 --> 38:25.696
(All are rare medicinal herbs
that are beneficial to one's health.)

38:25.710 --> 38:26.960
(Worth more than gold.)

38:27.960 --> 38:30.230
(The Crown Prince really
has been ill for so long.)

38:30.960 --> 38:32.190
I heard everything.

38:32.200 --> 38:33.890
You tried to kill
the commandery princess.

38:33.904 --> 38:36.180
You intended to provoke a conflict
between the two houses.

38:36.190 --> 38:37.230
Your crime is unforgivable.

38:38.280 --> 38:40.070
Please forgive me, Your Highness!

38:40.480 --> 38:42.280
I was merely jealous
of my third brother.

38:42.280 --> 38:44.110
He was always Father's favorite.

38:44.192 --> 38:45.888
That's why I made such a grave mistake.

38:46.320 --> 38:48.360
Please spare my life, Your Highness!

38:53.440 --> 38:54.670
I'm not the victim.

38:54.960 --> 38:56.150
Begging me won't help.

38:59.150 --> 39:00.710
I failed to know my place.

39:00.848 --> 39:02.336
I offended the commandery princess.

39:02.670 --> 39:04.320
Please spare me, Your Highness!

39:04.550 --> 39:06.190
Please forgive me, Your Highness!

39:08.630 --> 39:09.920
If you want my forgiveness,

39:10.016 --> 39:11.510
you should at least tell the truth.

39:12.670 --> 39:15.030
Who is the real mastermind?

39:15.510 --> 39:15.880
I...

39:18.760 --> 39:20.110
Think carefully.

39:20.800 --> 39:22.070
If you're imprisoned,

39:22.510 --> 39:23.630
what will your wife

39:24.070 --> 39:26.150
do to your sisters and concubines?

39:26.150 --> 39:27.480
You framed your own brother.

39:27.960 --> 39:28.800
How will

39:29.400 --> 39:30.550
your father deal with you?

39:33.000 --> 39:33.440
I...

39:41.230 --> 39:42.440
It was Xiao Jing.

39:42.960 --> 39:43.590
He said...

39:44.550 --> 39:46.920
He said he wanted to avenge his aunt.

39:48.032 --> 39:51.070
(The Xiao is the Duke of Wei's concubine
left behind in the imperial capital.)

39:51.630 --> 39:52.360
(Seems like)

39:52.510 --> 39:54.400
(she's enjoyed
an easy life for far too long.)

39:58.880 --> 40:00.336
- Take him away!
- Take him away!

40:02.230 --> 40:04.360
Thank you, Your Highness,
for standing up for me.

40:14.510 --> 40:16.480
You have traveled
all the way from the northwest.

40:16.920 --> 40:18.070
We mustn't let you suffer

40:18.260 --> 40:20.030
or disappoint
the soldiers of the northwest.

40:20.840 --> 40:22.440
I've had a long and tiring journey.

40:22.496 --> 40:23.920
My appearance is not presentable.

40:24.480 --> 40:26.800
I'll pay my respects
at the Eastern Palace another day.

40:28.150 --> 40:31.030
Then I'll await you
at the Eastern Palace.

40:49.480 --> 40:50.030
Your Highness,

40:50.440 --> 40:51.510
the commandery princess

40:51.510 --> 40:53.150
is bound to see you differently now.

40:55.400 --> 40:56.190
Naturally.

40:59.190 --> 41:01.670
The Crown Prince has lived
in seclusion for too long.

41:01.800 --> 41:02.880
He doesn't know propriety.

41:03.040 --> 41:05.190
He even dared to touch
the commandery princess's hand.

41:05.400 --> 41:06.510
That was rather improper.

41:07.660 --> 41:08.880
Good thing he won't live long.

41:25.190 --> 41:25.960
Throw Xiao out.

41:26.630 --> 41:27.400
You're not worthy

41:27.510 --> 41:28.440
of being my enemy.

41:28.480 --> 41:30.240
As long as Prince Kang's Manor
still stands,

41:30.250 --> 41:31.920
I'll make sure
you die a miserable death.

41:31.960 --> 41:33.110
The young master I marry

41:33.110 --> 41:34.480
will be the one I love.

41:34.480 --> 41:37.920
So you intend
to choose your own husband?

41:38.150 --> 41:39.630
If Your Highness has the time,

41:39.670 --> 41:41.030
allow me to be your guide.

41:41.030 --> 41:42.800
May I show Your Highness
around the capital?

41:47.710 --> 41:50.650
♪I've hidden so many words♪

41:51.270 --> 41:54.070
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

41:54.940 --> 42:01.910
♪So never uncover♪

42:02.100 --> 42:04.460
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

42:05.590 --> 42:08.320
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

42:09.280 --> 42:14.620
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

42:16.380 --> 42:19.200
♪Every answer I gave♪

42:20.000 --> 42:22.850
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

42:23.640 --> 42:27.010
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

42:27.270 --> 42:30.580
♪How hard it truly was?♪

42:33.550 --> 42:36.990
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

42:37.980 --> 42:40.310
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

42:41.580 --> 42:47.340
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

42:48.750 --> 42:51.880
♪It's a shame I never could♪

42:52.330 --> 42:55.340
♪Give you a moon in return♪

42:55.450 --> 43:02.090
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

43:02.090 --> 43:05.760
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

43:06.630 --> 43:09.390
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

43:09.830 --> 43:12.960
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

43:13.400 --> 43:19.350
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

43:20.750 --> 43:24.300
♪You'll never♪

43:24.580 --> 43:34.050
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪
